(GOVERNMENT OF INDIA - MINISTRY OF MICRO, SMALL AND MEDIUM ENTERPRISES) Tj
T*
(OPERATIONAL GUIDELINES: INTERNATIONAL COOPERATION \(IC\) SCHEME \(MSME-IC\) / OFFICE OF DEVELOPMENT COMMISSIONER \(MSME\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Overview & Objective:) Tj
T*
(Financial assistance to MSMEs for participating in international) Tj
T*
(exhibitions, trade fairs, buyer-seller meets, and technology transfer) Tj
T*
(delegations abroad.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Eligibility Criteria:) Tj
T*
(1. Registered MSME with valid Udyam Registration and active IEC \(Import) Tj
T*
(   Export Code\).) Tj
T*
(2. Must have an operational track record of at least 1 year.) Tj
T*
(3. Participating in international fairs or business delegations approved) Tj
T*
(   under the IC guidelines.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Financial Assistance and Subsidy:) Tj
T*
(1. Reimbursement of 100% economy class airfare \(up to Rs. 1.5 Lakh\) and 100%) Tj
T*
(   space/stall rent \(up to Rs. 3 Lakh\) for individual MSME exporters) Tj
T*
(   participating in foreign events.) Tj
T*
(2. Concession or margin money subsidy rate of 100.0 % subsidy.) Tj
T*
(3. Maximum financial assistance cap is Rs 4.5 Lakh per unit.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. Mandatory Documents Checklist:) Tj
T*
(1. Udyam Registration Certificate) Tj
T*
(2. Import Export Code \(IEC\) certificate) Tj
T*
(3. Passport and valid visa of travelling representative) Tj
T*
(4. Air tickets, boarding passes, and stall invoices) Tj
T*
(5. Outcome report of business meetings and export orders generated) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5. Application Procedure:) Tj
T*
(1. Mode: Online through IC Scheme Portal on MSME Champions) Tj
T*
(2. Official Portal: https://ic.msme.gov.in/) Tj
T*
